graduate program specialist two weeks in advance). Public attendees typical=
ly
have an opportunity to ask questions and comment following the seminar, aft=
er
which the committee meets with the student to further discuss the proposal.=
 The
advisory committee must then vote to accept or reject the proposal. The the=
sis
proposal defense must be passed a minimum<span style=3D'letter-spacing:2.0p=
t'> </span>of
one semester preceding the oral thesis defense (i.e., the proposal defense =
and
thesis defense cannot occur in the same semester). When the research is
completed, the final oral thesis defense is conducted similar to the propos=
al
defense.</span><span style=3D'font-size:7.5pt;mso-bidi-font-size:11.0pt;
line-height:111%'><o:p></o:p></span></p>

