ts
who<span style=3D'letter-spacing:2.0pt'> </span>receive grades lower than B
(including B- and grades of U in courses graded satisfactory/unsatisfactory=
) in
six semester hours or more will be dismissed from the program. It is a prog=
ram
requirement that all course work with a grade lower than B be retaken and
completed successfully, although both grades are still calculated in the GP=
A.</span></p>

<p class=3DMsoBodyText style=3D'margin-top:7.5pt;margin-right:11.1pt;margin=
