 the
satisfaction and productivity of employees, and the study of technological
influences on human performance.</span></p>

<p class=3DMsoBodyText style=3D'margin-top:7.5pt;margin-right:16.45pt;margi=
n-bottom:
0in;margin-left:24.7pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:111%'><span
style=3D'mso-font-width:110%'>The doctoral program provides students with
