<p class=3DMsoBodyText style=3D'margin-top:8.55pt;line-height:111%'><span
style=3D'mso-font-width:110%'>The Psychology PhD program in Industrial and
Organizational Psychology (I/O) requires four to five years of full-time st=
udy
beyond the baccalaureate and three to four years beyond the master's. The f=
irst
few years are devoted to course work and the final year to the doctoral
dissertation.</span></p>

