n-bottom:
0in;margin-left:24.7pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:111%'><span
style=3D'mso-font-width:110%'>All students are required to complete a Maste=
r of
Science (MS) degree &#8220;along-the-way&#8221; that includes 38 credit hou=
rs
and a thesis. This requirement can be waived by the program director for
students entering the doctoral program with a master's degree based on<span
style=3D'letter-spacing:4.0pt'> </span>courses taken and the quality of the
thesis completed at the previous institution.</span></p>

