research proposal and areas of weakness previously identified in the written
(qualifying) exam. A majority vote is required to pass the examination;
however, no more than one negative vote is permitted. The majority must inc=
lude
the dissertation advisor. Any student failing the examination must repeat t=
he
examination within six calendar months of the date of the first examination=
