111%'><span style=3D'mso-font-width:110%'>gaps in knowledge exist. Justify =
the
need for the research by explaining its anticipated significance. Conclude =
by
linking gaps in current knowledge to the proposed specific aims. Methodolog=
y:
Outline carefully the study design (observations, experiments, models,
statistical analysis, etc.) related to, and the methodology to be used for,
each specific aim. Methodologies should be explained in sufficient detail to
allow committee members to assess the validity of its use in the study.
Potential outcomes and alternative approaches should be discussed. Literatu=
re
Cited: References should be indicated in the main body of the proposal wher=
ever
appropriate and should follow the format of a peer-reviewed journal in a fi=
eld
of study appropriate to the research.</span></p>

