ing
intelligence gaps, interpreting and evaluating information from multiple (a=
nd
sometimes contradictory) sources, monitoring trends and events related to a
particular country or issue, and preparing written and oral assessments.&qu=
ot;
This expectation comes from the job description for an intelligence analyst
established by the federal government posted here.</span></p>

