innovative and unique subfield. It is distinct from other communication
subfields in that it is intentionally goal-driven communication wherein
communication scholars work in partnership with professionals in the public=
 and
private sectors to solve real-world problems.</span></p>

<p class=3DMsoBodyText style=3D'margin-top:7.45pt;margin-right:16.45pt;marg=
in-bottom:
0in;margin-left:24.7pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:111%'><span
