mpus
with access to arts, culture, nightlife, and <span style=3D'letter-spacing:=
-.1pt'>business.</span></span></p>

<p class=3DMsoBodyText style=3D'margin-top:7.5pt;margin-right:16.45pt;margi=
n-bottom:
0in;margin-left:24.7pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:111%'><span
style=3D'mso-font-width:110%'>The Strategic Communication PhD requires a mi=
nimum
of 60 credit hours beyond the master's degree. The zero-hour Doctoral
Colloquium will be required in the fall semesters of the first year. This
course will introduce students to professional standards and practices
associated with doctoral-level training in the field of Strategic
Communication.</span></p>

